tion']\n        \n        equipment_manager.add_equipment(name, type, quantity, condition, location)\n    ENDIF\n\n    equipment_list = equipment_manager.equipment\n    RETURN render_template('dashboard.html', equipment=equipment_list)\nEND FUNCTION\n\nFUNCTION add_equipment(name, type, quantity, condition, location)\n    equipment.append([name, type, str(quantity), condition, location])\n    save_equipment()  // Calls a helper function to save equipment data\nEND FUNCTION\n```\n**Key Functionality:**\n- The dashboard function handles displaying equipment and processing the addition of new equipment. It retrieves the current equipment list and renders the dashboard template.\n- The `add_equipment` method updates the internal equipment list and persists this data to a file.\n\n**Third-party Library:**\n- **Flask**: Used again to manage web routes and render HTML templates for the user interface.\n\n---"]
